Reverse engineer the following code and explain the logic of it. def find_smallest_multiple(n):
    x = n
    while True:
        if isDivisible(x, n):
            return x
        x += n

Describe the overall purpose of the code snippet. def quick_sort(arr): 
    if len(arr) <= 1: 
        return arr 
    else: 
        return quick_sort([x for x in arr[1:] if x < arr[0]]) + [arr[0]] + quick_sort([x for x in arr[1:] if x >= arr[0]])
